# Production build configuration. Vite inlines VITE_* values at build time,
# so the release pipeline picks these up wherever the build runs (see
# docs/DEPLOY.md "Contribution links"). A Stripe Payment Link is a public
# checkout URL, not a secret; normalizeSupportUrl still validates it at
# runtime, so a test-mode or non-Stripe value renders nothing.
